      "title": "Realty Income Raised Its 2026 AFFO Guidance. Here's What That Means for Its 5.2% Dividend.",
      "summary": "Realty Income raised its 2026 AFFO guidance to $4.44-$4.45 per share, exceeding consensus estimates of $4.37. The REIT reported strong Q2 earnings with revenue ahead of expectations and maintained a 98.8% portfolio occupancy rate. The company is expanding into data centers through a $1.4 billion joint venture and increased full-year investment guidance to $10 billion. Higher AFFO should support continued dividend growth for the company known for its reliable monthly dividend payments.",
